Package: SpaDES.tools
Type: Package
Title: Minimal 'SpaDES.tools' Stand-in for NetLogoR in webR
Version: 2.1.1.9001
Description: NetLogoR's neighbors(), diffuse() and torus wrapping call
    SpaDES.tools::adj() and SpaDES.tools::wrap(); without them those
    primitives stop with "Please install.packages('SpaDES.tools')". The real
    package depends on 'terra', which cannot load in webR, so this package
    ports just those two functions to plain R, matching SpaDES.tools 2.1.1
    behaviour (column order, cell numbering and row order included).
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: methods
Suggests: data.table
Encoding: UTF-8
